      '广告以带固定 “Sponsored” 角标的独立区块呈现，绝不与自然结果混排；hover 广告不会改变任何等级色。',
      '站长验证、徽章、证据链与评分变化通知永久免费。免费层绝不设限逼升级。',
    ],
    dataHeading: '数据来源',
    dataItems: [
      ['种子集', 'Tranco 每日 Top 1M（tranco-list.eu，学术用途免费署名）。'],
      ['扫描证据', '公开快照提交至 github.com/AFR-IM/AFR-data——git 版本化即审计轨迹。'],
      ['纠错通道', '向数据仓提 PR（corrections/）即触发重扫复核；已验证站方可发布声明。'],
    ],
    schemaHeading: '机读标准',
    schemaBody: '整套标准以 JSON 形式提供在 /api/v1/method（三层、每个子项分值、等级阈值），工具无需抓取本页即可消费。',
    schemaLink: '打开 /api/v1/method',
    license: 'AFR v1.1 以 CC BY 4.0 发布——署名后可自由复用。',
  },
} as const;

const P = PROSE[locale === 'zh-CN' ? 'zh-CN' : 'en'];
const lang = isZh ? 'zh' : 'en';

/* ── structured data derived from AFR_METHOD ──────────────────────────── */

type GroupKey = keyof typeof P.groups;
const groupsOf = (layerId: 'L1' | 'L2' | 'L3') => {
  const layer = AFR_METHOD.layers.find((l) => l.id === layerId)!;
  const out: { key: GroupKey; total: number; checks: typeof layer.checks }[] = [];
  for (const c of layer.checks) {
    const key = c.id.split('.')[0] as GroupKey;
    const last = out[out.length - 1];
    if (last && last.key === key) last.checks.push(c);
    else out.push({ key, total: 0, checks: [c] });
  }
  for (const g of out) g.total = g.checks.reduce((n, c) => n + c.points, 0);
  return out;
};

const FAMILY_ORDER = ['search', 'hybrid', 'training'] as const;
const familyOf = (c: { family?: string }) =>
  (FAMILY_ORDER as readonly string[]).includes(c.family ?? '') ? (c.family as string) : '';

const descOf = (id: string, ua?: string, family?: string) => {
  if (ua && family) return P.familyNote(ua, P.families[family as keyof typeof P.families]);
  const entry = (P.checkDescriptions as Record<string, [string, string]>)[id];
  if (!entry) return '';
  return lang === 'zh' ? entry[1] : entry[0];
};

const rangeOf = (min: number, prevMin?: number) => `${min}–${prevMin !== undefined ? prevMin - 1 : 100}`;

const cloneSnippet = `git clone https://github.com/AFR-IM/AFR-web
cd AFR-web
npm test   # = node --test packages/*/test/*.test.ts`;

const runSnippet = `import { scoreAfr } from './packages/afr/src/index.ts';
import snapshot from './scans/github.com.json' with { type: 'json' };

const result = scoreAfr(snapshot.signals);
console.log(result.score, result.grade, result.engineVersion);`;

const strategyOrder: StrategyTagType[] = ['AI-Open', 'Middle-Path', 'Training-Open', 'AI-Closed', 'Unconfigured'];

const sectionIds = ['layers', 'checks', 'grades', 'engine', 'recompute', 'neutrality', 'data', 'schema'];

/* ── FAQPage structured data (product FAQ; mirrors the page's own prose) ── */
const FAQ = {
  en: [
    {
      q: 'How does the AFR rating work?',
      a: 'AFR scans only public signals — robots.txt, llms.txt, sitemap, structured data, semantic HTML, public APIs, and agent instructions — with a fixed budget of HTTP requests. Each of the 100 possible points belongs to a named sub-check with published evidence, and the total is the sum of three layers: Reachability (35), Legibility (40), and Actionability (25).',
    },
    {
      q: 'Does the scan collect private data or require a login?',
      a: 'No. The scanner fetches only public pages with a transparent, identified user-agent, never logs in, and never collects personal data. Everything it uses to score a site can be downloaded again by anyone, which is what makes the score reproducible.',
    },
    {
      q: "How can I improve my site's score?",
      a: 'Allow the known AI crawler families in robots.txt instead of blocking them, keep the homepage reachable without JavaScript or a login wall, publish a sitemap and an llms.txt file, mark up your content with JSON-LD, keep exactly one clear h1 plus a meta description, and publish a documented API with agent instructions at /agents.md. The check tables above list every sub-check with its points.',
    },
    {
      q: 'What do the grades A through F mean?',
      a: 'Grades are coordinates on an openness scale: A (75–100) is open to AI crawlers and agents, B and C are partially open, D is mostly closed, and F (0–24) actively blocks AI access. They describe technical openness to automated visitors, not the quality of the site\'s content.',
    },
    {
      q: 'Do paid placements change grades or ranking?',
      a: 'No. Paid placements appear only in separately labeled sponsored blocks. The natural ranking is always a pure AFR-score descending order, and verification, badges, evidence chains, and score-change notifications stay free.',
    },
  ],
  'zh-CN': [
    {
      q: 'AFR 评级是如何运作的？',
      a: 'AFR 只扫描公开信号——robots.txt、llms.txt、sitemap、结构化数据、语义化 HTML、公开 API 与 Agent 指令——且抓取预算固定。100 分中的每个分值都属于一个具名子项并附带公开证据，总分来自三层之和：可达层（35）、可懂层（40）、可交互层（25）。',
    },
    {
      q: '扫描会采集隐私数据或要求登录吗？',
      a: '不会。扫描器只用透明、可识别的 User-Agent 抓取公开页面，从不登录、从不采集个人数据。它用来打分的一切别人都能重新下载——这正是分数可复现的原因。',
    },
    {
      q: '如何提升自己网站的分数？',
      a: '在 robots.txt 中显式放行已知的 AI 爬虫家族而不是屏蔽；保证首页不依赖 JS、无登录墙即可读；发布 sitemap 与 llms.txt；用 JSON-LD 标注内容；全页只有一个清晰的 h1 与 meta description；再公开一份有文档的 API 与 /agents.md Agent 指令。上面的子项表列出了每个子项及其分值。',
    },
    {
      q: 'A 到 F 的等级是什么意思？',
      a: '等级是开放度坐标：A（75–100）对 AI 爬虫与智能体完全开放，B、C 部分开放，D 大部分关闭，F（0–24）主动屏蔽 AI 访问。它描述的是对自动访问者的技术开放度，不是内容质量。',
    },
    {
      q: '付费展示会改变等级或排名吗？',
      a: '不会。付费展示只出现在独立标注的赞助区块中。自然排名永远是纯 AFR 分数降序，验证、徽章、证据链与分数变化通知永久免费。',
    },
  ],
}[locale];

const faqJsonLd = JSON.stringify({
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'FAQPage',
  mainEntity: FAQ.map((item) => ({
    '@type': 'Question',
    name: item.q,
    acceptedAnswer: { '@type': 'Answer', text: item.a },
  })),
}).replace(/</g, '\\u003c');
---

<Base title={P.title} description={P.description}>
  <script type="application/ld+json" is:inline set:html={faqJsonLd}></script>
  <div class="container method">
    <header class="hero">
      <p class="eyebrow mono">AFR v{AFR_METHOD.version}</p>
      <h1>{P.title}</h1>
      <p class="lede">{P.intro}</p>
      <nav class="toc" aria-label="contents">
        {
          sectionIds.map((id, i) => (
            <a class="chip" href={`#${id}`}>
              {P.toc[i]}
            </a>
          ))
        }
      </nav>
    </header>

    <!-- (a) three-layer model -->
    <section class="sec" id="layers">
      <h2>{P.layerHeading}</h2>
      <p>{P.layerIntro}</p>
      <table class="tbl">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>{P.colLayer}</th>
            <th>{P.colQuestion}</th>
            <th class="num">{P.colWeight}</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {
            AFR_METHOD.layers.map((layer) => (
              <tr>
                <td>
                  <span class="lid mono">{layer.id}</span>{' '}
                  {layer.name[lang as 'en' | 'zh'] ?? L.layers[layer.id]}
                </td>
                <td>{P.questions[layer.id]}</td>
                <td class="num">{layer.weight}</td>
              </tr>
            ))
          }
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </section>

    <!-- (b) full check tables per layer -->
    <section class="sec" id="checks">
      <h2>{P.checksHeading}</h2>
      <p>{P.checksIntro}</p>

      {
        AFR_METHOD.layers.map((layer) => (
          <div class="layer-block">
            <h3 class="layer-h">
              <span class="lid mono">{layer.id}</span> {layer.name[lang as 'en' | 'zh'] ?? L.layers[layer.id]}
              <span class="w mono">
                {layer.weight} {lang === 'zh' ? '分' : 'points'}
              </span>
            </h3>
            <p class="layer-intro">{P.layerIntros[layer.id]}</p>

            {groupsOf(layer.id).map((g) => {
              const [gName, gIntro] = P.groups[g.key];
              return (
                <div class="group">
                  <h4 class="group-h">
                    <span class="mono">{g.key}</span> {gName}
                    <span class="g-total mono">
                      {g.total} {lang === 'zh' ? '分' : 'pts'}
                    </span>
                  </h4>
                  <p class="group-intro">{gIntro}</p>
                  <table class="tbl dense">
                    <thead>
                      <tr>
                        <th>{P.colId}</th>
                        <th>{P.colFamily}</th>
                        <th>{P.colUa}</th>
                        <th class="num">{P.colPoints}</th>
                        <th>{P.colMeasures}</th>
                      </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                      {g.checks.map((c) => {
                        const fam = familyOf(c);
                        return (
                          <tr>
                            <td class="mono id-cell">{c.id}</td>
                            <td>{fam ? P.families[fam as keyof typeof P.families] : '—'}</td>
                            <td class="mono">{c.ua ?? '—'}</td>
                            <td class="num">{c.points}</td>
                            <td>{descOf(c.id, c.ua, fam)}</td>
                          </tr>
                        );
                      })}
                      <tr class="subtotal">
                        <td colspan={3}>{P.familySubtotal}</td>
                        <td class="num">{g.total}</td>
                        <td />
                      </tr>
                    </tbody>
                  </table>
                </div>
              );
            })}
          </div>
        ))
      }
    </section>

    <!-- (c) grades + strategy tags -->
    <section class="sec" id="grades">
      <h2>{P.gradesHeading}</h2>
      <p>{P.gradesIntro}</p>
      <table class="tbl">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>{P.colGrade}</th>
            <th class="num">{P.colRange}</th>
            <th>{P.colLabel}</th>
            <th>{P.colMeaning}</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {
            AFR_METHOD.grades.map((g, i) => {
              const info = L.grades[g.grade as 'A' | 'B' | 'C' | 'D' | 'F'];
              return (
                <tr>
                  <td>
                    <span class="sw" style={`background:var(--grade-${g.grade.toLowerCase()});`} />
                    <span class="mono g-letter" style={`color:var(--grade-${g.grade.toLowerCase()});`}>
                      {g.grade}
                    </span>
                  </td>
                  <td class="num">{rangeOf(g.min, i > 0 ? AFR_METHOD.grades[i - 1]!.min : undefined)}</td>
                  <td>{info?.label ?? g.grade}</td>
                  <td>{info?.slogan ?? ''}</td>
                </tr>
              );
            })
          }
        </tbody>
      </table>

      <h3 class="sub-h">{P.strategiesHeading}</h3>
      <p>{P.strategiesIntro}</p>
      <ul class="strats">
        {
          strategyOrder.map((t) => (
            <li>
              <StrategyTag tag={t} locale={locale} />
              <span class="strat-desc">{L.strategies[t]?.desc ?? t}</span>
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- (d) engine versions -->
    <section class="sec" id="engine">
      <h2>{P.engineHeading}</h2>
      <p>{P.engineIntro}</p>
      <table class="tbl">
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <th class="row-h">{P.rowStandard}</th>
            <td class="mono">AFR v{AFR_METHOD.version}</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th class="row-h">{P.rowEngine}</th>
            <td class="mono">{ENGINE_VERSION}</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th class="row-h">{P.rowScanner}</th>
            <td class="mono">{SCANNER_VERSION}</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th class="row-h">{P.rowUa}</th>
            <td class="mono ua">{USER_AGENT}</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
      <p class="note">{P.engineNote}</p>
      <p class="honest mono">{P.honestyLine}</p>
    </section>

    <!-- (e) recompute guide -->
    <section class="sec" id="recompute">
      <h2>{L.ui.recomputeTitle ?? P.recomputeHeading}</h2>
      <p>{P.recomputeIntro}</p>
      <p class="step">{P.recomputeClone}</p>
      <pre class="mono"><code>{cloneSnippet}</code></pre>
      <p class="step">{P.recomputeRun}</p>
      <pre class="mono"><code>{runSnippet}</code></pre>
    </section>

    <!-- (f) neutrality pledge -->
    <section class="sec" id="neutrality">
      <h2>{P.neutralityHeading}</h2>
      <p class="pledge-lead">{L.ui.neutralityStatement ?? P.neutralityIntro}</p>
      <p class="pledge-intro">{P.neutralityIntro}</p>
      <ul class="pledge">
        {P.neutralityPledge.map((line) => <li>{line}</li>)}
      </ul>
      <p class="pledge-foot mono">{L.ui.footerPledge}</p>
    </section>

    <!-- (g) data sources -->
    <section class="sec" id="data">
      <h2>{P.dataHeading}</h2>
      <dl class="sources">
        {
          P.dataItems.map(([k, v]) => (
            <div class="src-row">
              <dt class="mono">{k}</dt>
              <dd>{v}</dd>
            </div>
          ))
        }
      </dl>
    </section>

    <!-- (h) machine-readable schema + license -->
    <section class="sec" id="schema">
      <h2>{P.schemaHeading}</h2>
      <p>{P.schemaBody}</p>
      <p>
        <a class="btn" href="/api/v1/method">{P.schemaLink}</a>
      </p>
      <p class="license mono">{P.license}</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .method {
    padding-top: 32px;
    padding-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .hero {
    max-width: 820px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }
  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--brand);
  }
  .hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(28px, 4.4vw, 42px);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .lede {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-2);
  }
  .toc {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-top: 18px;
  }
  .toc .chip {
    font-size: 12px;
    transition: border-color var(--t-micro) var(--ease), color var(--t-micro) var(--ease);
  }
  .toc .chip:hover {
    border-color: var(--brand);
    color: var(--brand);
  }

  .sec {
    background: var(--bg-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 26px 26px 24px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    scroll-margin-top: 84px;
  }
  .sec h2 {
    font-size: 22px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .sec > p {
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    color: var(--text-2);
    max-width: 78ch;
  }
  .sub-h {
    font-size: 17px;
    margin: 26px 0 8px;
  }

  /* tables */
  .tbl {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: 13.5px;
  }
  .tbl th,
  .tbl td {
    text-align: left;
    vertical-align: top;
    padding: 9px 10px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .tbl thead th {
    font-size: 11px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: var(--text-3);
    font-weight: 600;
    border-bottom-color: var(--text-3);
  }
  .tbl tbody tr:hover td {
    background: var(--bg-elevated);
  }
  .tbl .num {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    white-space: nowrap;
    width: 72px;
  }
  .tbl.dense {
    font-size: 13px;
  }
  .tbl.dense th,
  .tbl.dense td {
    padding: 7px 9px;
  }
  .id-cell {
    font-size: 12.5px;
    color: var(--text-2);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .row-h {
    width: 180px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--text-2);
    font-size: 13px;
  }
  .ua {
    word-break: break-all;
  }
  .subtotal td {
    color: var(--text-3);
    font-size: 11.5px;
    border-bottom: none;
    padding-top: 6px;
  }
  .subtotal:hover td {
    background: transparent;
  }

  .layer-block {
    margin-top: 26px;
  }
  .layer-h {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 10px;
    font-size: 17px;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
    padding-bottom: 8px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .lid {
    color: var(--brand);
    font-size: 14px;
  }
  .w {
    margin-left: auto;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--text-3);
  }
  .layer-intro {
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    color: var(--text-2);
    max-width: 82ch;
  }
  .group {
    margin-bottom: 22px;
  }
  .group-h {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 8px;
    font-size: 15px;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .group-h .g-total {
    margin-left: auto;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--text-3);
    font-weight: 400;
  }
  .group-intro {
    margin: 0 0 10px;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    color: var(--text-3);
    max-width: 82ch;
  }

  /* grades */
  .sw {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 12px;
    height: 12px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    margin-right: 8px;
    vertical-align: -1px;
  }
  .g-letter {
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .strats {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .strats li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 12px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .strat-desc {
    font-size: 13.5px;
    color: var(--text-2);
  }

  .note {
    font-size: 13.5px;
    color: var(--text-2);
  }
  .honest {
    padding: 10px 12px;
    background: var(--bg-elevated);
    border-left: 2px solid var(--brand);
    border-radius: 0 var(--r-1) var(--r-1) 0;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-1);
  }

  .step {
    margin: 16px 0 8px;
    color: var(--text-2);
    font-size: 14px;
  }
  pre {
    margin: 0 0 4px;
    padding: 14px 16px;
    background: var(--bg-ink);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--r-2);
    overflow-x: auto;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12.5px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-1);
  }

  .pledge-lead {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 20px;
    color: var(--text-1) !important;
    margin-bottom: 4px !important;
  }
  .pledge-intro {
    margin-bottom: 14px !important;
    font-size: 13.5px;
  }
  .pledge {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 18px;
    display: grid;
    gap: 10px;
    color: var(--text-2);
    max-width: 82ch;
  }
  .pledge-foot {
    margin: 18px 0 0;
    padding-top: 12px;
    border-top: 1px dashed var(--line);
    font-size: 12.5px;
    color: var(--brand);
  }

  .sources {
    margin: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .src-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 160px 1fr;
    gap: 12px;
    padding-bottom: 12px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .src-row:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
    padding-bottom: 0;
  }
  .src-row dt {
    font-size: 12.5px;
    color: var(--text-3);
  }
  .src-row dd {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    color: var(--text-2);
  }

  .license {
    font-size: 12.5px;
    color: var(--text-3);
    margin: 6px 0 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .sec {
      padding: 20px 16px;
    }
    .tbl {
      display: block;
      overflow-x: auto;
    }
    .src-row {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 4px;
    }
    .layer-h {
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
  }
</style>
